; Supported regression pin: an alias-hop cycle whose plain-typename entry rule sorts before its
; collection rule. The recursive-type boundary auto-`@newtype`s the named collection, so this must
; generate under default wasm-bearing flags just as the collection-first spelling in
; `recursive_alias_hop.cddl` does. Rule naming and ordering do not change the support verdict.
hop_alias = hop_arr
hop_arr = [* hop_alias]
